      "thumbnailUrl": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Nephrite_jade_ventifact_%28Precambrian%3B_Granite_Mountains%2C_Wyoming%2C_USA%29_6.jpg/960px-Nephrite_jade_ventifact_%28Precambrian%3B_Granite_Mountains%2C_Wyoming%2C_USA%29_6.jpg",
